        "Image 1 is the reference sheet for LEAD (Walt Harmon). Image 2 is a front portrait of LEAD.\nKeep LEAD's exact face, skin tone, skin texture and hair from images 1 and 2. Do not beautify or change their age.\nLEAD: Retired harbour pilot. Tall and lean, usually in a navy wool peacoat over a dark knit sweater.\nLEAD looks up from a sealed envelope toward the diner door, and almost smiles.\nClose-up of the face, 35mm lens, lit only by practical lamps in the scene.\nNatural skin texture with visible pores, real lens imperfections.",
